Z||000012||Ken Wittlief||05-07-2001||02:50 PM||||Okay, I think I have this figured out. After I put the sunroof back on last night I sat and played with the radio with the windows closed.<P>and guess what - the bass slider on the radio still doesnt do anything.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>so I guess the slider is dirty inside, or a solder connection is loose, or maybe there is a subwoofer under my leaky heater core that is now ruined. (I bypassed the heatercore) <P>Guess I'll either have to pull the radio and look into the bass slider control, or see if there is a subwoofer under the dash.<P>  at least my instincts were correct - something was a-miss, it was only a coincidence that I noticed the difference when I had the sunroof off and the windows open.||||reg||1
